schema: backlog-lean
context: |
  Read docs/spec-workflow.md for the project's source map, depth policy,
  specification format, Backlog handoff and closure procedure.
  Backlog.md is the only task tracker. Do not generate tasks.md or copy task status.
  Follow the applicable agent guide and approved project language policy.
rules:
  proposal:
    - State the actor, outcome, scope and unresolved decisions before mechanisms.
  specs:
    - Keep observable behavior separate from implementation mechanisms.
    - Include relevant negative scenarios and measurable quality requirements.
